<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T8.7.2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[26, 30]: </span><span id="A1.T8.7.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">in an early phase of career development</span><span id="A1.T8.7.2.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T8.7.2.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[31, 40]: </span><span id="A1.T8.7.2.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">in a career-building stage</span><span id="A1.T8.7.2.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span>
