<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T8.7.3.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[111, 150]: </span><span id="A1.T8.7.3.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">a strong professional income</span><span id="A1.T8.7.3.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span>
